OL,3,GNEWSAPledge of #5m to improve women's  
OL,4,Asafety on transport                    
OL,6,FA #5m plan will work to improve safety 
OL,7,Ffor women and girls on a region's bus  
OL,8,Fand train network.                     
OL,10,FThe North East Mayoral Strategic       
OL,11,FAuthority (NEMSA) approved the project 
OL,12,Fafter a study found almost 90% of women
OL,13,Fhave felt unsafe or uncomfortable while
OL,14,Ftravelling in the region.              
OL,16,FLabour Mayor Kim McGuinness said the   
OL,17,Fissue was "close to her heart" as she  
OL,18,Fhad also felt unsafe while travelling. 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
